\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Wikidata-linked recipients by branch of the reporting agency. A person who received gifts under several branches is counted in each. ``Female'' is the share of people with a recorded gender. ``Military'' means a recorded military rank (P410) or military occupation (P106). ``Diplomat'' and ``Law'' are occupation groups. ``Party member'' means any recorded party membership (P102). ``Studied abroad'' is the share of people with at least one school of known country who attended a school outside the United States. Missing statements count as absent, so shares other than ``Female'' and ``Studied abroad'' are lower bounds.}}{14}{table.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
